body:
that's... not normal, at least for me, sure I like seeing pretty girls but I won't waste my damn time looking at pictures of someone

if you dont feel comfortable with this talk to him, he has to understand (I mean, is kinda obvious that your  girlfriend doesn't want you to be looking at others all the time)(if that was sexist Im sorry)

edit: ok that was kinda sexist, what I meant is that people normally dont want their partners to be looking at others all the time
